  "releaseNotes": "v1.5.0 — Live text editing: double-click any highlighted text on the live preview to edit it in place, saved in the background. Device preview (Desktop/Tablet/Mobile) via a real iframe so responsive breakpoints re-trigger. Automatic page version history with one-click restore. Merged CardBlock + MultiCard into one flexible card block with horizontal/overlay layouts. Refreshed the block showcase to list all 50+ blocks. v1.4.0 — Navbar auto-shows published top-level pages alongside configured menu items with dropdown children support; seed items auto-clear on first real page publish. Fixed 404 on root URL. Fixed admin anti-forgery token rendering. Improved route ordering (CMS before Blazor). v1.2.3 — Fix custom icon in Visual Studio New Project dialog. v1.2.2 — AiClientFactory multi-provider abstraction, AES-256-GCM EncryptionService, ApiKey model, improved PDF chunking. v1.2.0 — Gemini cloud AI (free tier BYOK), full Headless REST API with nested block tree, 45+ blocks, PDF upload via admin panel, improved security headers.",
